example:
规则只比较属性，不登记具体的人：

```java
record Subject(String role, String department) {}
record Folder(String kind) {}

static boolean allowView(Subject subject, Folder folder, String action) {
  return "view".equals(action)
      && "Nurse Practitioner".equals(subject.role())
      && "Cardiology".equals(subject.department())
      && "Heart Patients".equals(folder.kind());
}
```
